{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "963de7c2-e317-463c-8c9f-eea52f4a9d2e",
    "name": "Wedding Album API",
    "description": "API REST del álbum de bodas. Ejecuta las carpetas en orden (00 → 07): cada paso guarda en el\nentorno los ids y tokens que usan los siguientes (adminToken, clientToken, eventId, eventCode,\nguestToken, mediaId, uploadUrl, galleryCursor).\n\nPaso manual: tras \"Registrar cliente\" la API imprime el magic link en la consola del servidor\n(en desarrollo no hay proveedor de correo). Copia el valor de `token=` del enlace a la variable\n`magicToken` del entorno y sigue con \"Verificar magic link\".",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{host}}/health"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "auth": {
        "type": "noauth"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "01 Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login superadmin",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
            "description": "Crea antes el superadmin con `npm run seed:superadmin`. Guarda `adminToken`.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.environment.set('adminToken', pm.response.json().data.accessToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Registrar cliente",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
            "description": "Un cliente (rol USER) se crea sin contraseña y recibe un magic link. En desarrollo el enlace sale en la consola del servidor: copia su `token` a la variable `magicToken`. 409 si el correo ya existe.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{adminToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{clientEmail}}\",\n  \"name\": \"Ana\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Martínez\",\n  \"eventQuota\": 2\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 o 409 (ya existe)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([201, 409]));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) pm.environment.set('clientId', String(pm.response.json().data.id));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Registrar admin",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
            "description": "El staff (SUPER_ADMIN, ADMIN) necesita contraseña confirmada de 12+ caracteres. Un ADMIN solo puede crear clientes.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{adminToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"moderadora@example.com\",\n  \"name\": \"Moderadora\",\n  \"role\": \"ADMIN\",\n  \"password\": \"una-contraseña-segura\",\n  \"confirmedPassword\": \"una-contraseña-segura\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 o 409 (ya existe)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([201, 409]));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Pedir magic link",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/magic-link",
            "description": "Siempre responde 202 (no revela si el correo existe). Solo envía enlace a clientes activos.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{clientEmail}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 202', () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Verificar magic link",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Client-Type",
                "value": "mobile"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/magic-link/verify",
            "description": "Un solo uso, caduca en 15 min. Con `X-Client-Type: mobile` el refresh token viene en el body (sin el header va en una cookie httpOnly). Guarda `clientToken` y `refreshToken`.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{magicToken}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const data = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "pm.environment.set('clientToken', data.accessToken);",
                  "pm.environment.set('refreshToken', data.refreshToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Client-Type",
                "value": "mobile"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh",
            "description": "Rota el refresh token: el anterior queda revocado. Reusar uno revocado cierra todas las sesiones del usuario.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const data = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "pm.environment.set('clientToken', data.accessToken);",
                  "pm.environment.set('refreshToken', data.refreshToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Mi usuario",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/user/me",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{clientToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "description": "Login del staff con contraseña, alta de clientes, magic link, refresh y logout.",
      "auth": {
        "type": "noauth"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "02 Admin",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar clientes",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/clients?status=ACTIVE"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "// Si el cliente ya existía (409 al registrar), toma su id de aquí.",
                  "const me = pm.response.json().data.find(c => c.email === pm.environment.get('clientEmail'));",
                  "if (me) pm.environment.set('clientId', String(me.id));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar cliente",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
